WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.002
Today is the last of the eight sounds.

2
00:00:02.452 --> 00:00:09.264
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.764 --> 00:00:12.343
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:12.843 --> 00:00:14.851
Old sounds first. All seven.

5
00:00:16.235 --> 00:00:17.061
As in moon.

6
00:00:18.597 --> 00:00:19.463
As in nest.

7
00:00:24.644 --> 00:00:25.590
Now the new one.

8
00:00:26.669 --> 00:00:29.417
As in dog. Pat your knee, like calling a dog.

9
00:00:30.795 --> 00:00:35.833
It is a quick sound, like the two from day three. Here are the three quick ones together.

10
00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:41.854
Keep each one tiny, with nothing added on the end.

11
00:00:42.304 --> 00:00:45.411
Now the words. Today most of them have three sounds.

12
00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:49.954
The word is sad.

13
00:00:53.535 --> 00:00:54.533
The word is dip.

14
00:00:55.433 --> 00:01:00.146
Read the first word together. Then press play on the listening track, and step away.

15
00:01:00.596 --> 00:01:05.151
At the end, your child reads three words to you. Now all eight sounds have been met.
